WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.580
Viewings: viewings, test drives, sea trials and interviews; their times and each one's outcome.

2
00:00:09.128 --> 00:00:15.390
Open the request, set the time with "Set the time" and click "Confirm and tell the person".

3
00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:19.330
If Appointments is on, change viewing times there.

4
00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:23.500
After the viewing, record the "Outcome" and "Feedback".

5
00:00:24.054 --> 00:00:28.720
Write the outcome the same day; the next follow-up is built from it.
